# Shell scripts and workflow YAML must keep LF endings on every platform: CRLF
# breaks a script's shebang and makes bash choke on `set -euo pipefail` when
# GitHub's Linux runners execute it, and this repository is developed on
# Windows (where the Rust sources are CRLF, which rustc accepts either way).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
